{{!--
  Antora supplies the page title separately from the body (page.contents holds
  the converted AsciiDoc *below* the document title). Render the title here as
  the page's H1, unless the page opts out via the noheader/notitle roles.
--}}
{{#unless page.noheader}}
<h1 class="page">{{{page.title}}}</h1>
{{/unless}}
{{{page.contents}}}
